{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9888fa319295b3bc","name":"Vanguard Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-9888fa319295b3bc","title":"Vanguard Talent Tree","revision":20088,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:11:02Z","sha256":"84929630a64fcffae1c8c7833e6f6a5b498b389674f04fb87fb316f8d0a19469","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20088","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Vanguard%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9888fa319295b3bc","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As an expert in the art of scouting enemy formations, you are a valuable asset to any military force. Your ability to see what lies ahead on the battlefield is uncanny.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Enhanced Vision"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When actively looking for hidden enemies, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Impenetrable Cover"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Maximize Cover"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," against a target, you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," equal to your Class Level against that target until the start of your next turn, provided you still have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," from the target at the time the attack is made.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Invisible Attacker"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Maximize Cover"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If your target is unaware of you, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," deal +1 die of damage against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Mark the Target"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you damage a target with a non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," ranged attack, you may designate one ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". Your target is considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against that ally's first attack made before the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Maximize Cover"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When an opponent uses the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," Action to negate your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check opposed by the attacker's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," check. If successful, you retain your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonus.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shellshock"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Soften the Target"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you damage a target that is unaware of you with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},", that target is considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Soften the Target"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you damage a target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", you may designate one ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". The ally you designate ignores the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," (if any) until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Triangulate"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Enhanced Vision"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you and at least one other ally have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to and are aware of a target, you and all allies that can hear and understand you can reroll one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," roll against that target, accepting the second result even if it is worse. You and your allies can only gain the benefits of this Talent once per encounter.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
